# TradingAgents SDLC

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ops/agent-map.md` before work.

## Before Work

- Confirm repository root, branch, full HEAD, remotes, and dirty state.
- Classify the task as audit, planning, execution, PR/sync, or release.
- Load the matching domain contract.
- Preserve unrelated user changes.

## Engineering Rules

- Make the smallest contract-complete change.
- Do not add speculative features or mix unrelated refactors.
- Preserve point-in-time and vendor failure semantics.
- Keep data/provider access behind existing tool/dataflow boundaries.
- Keep LLM narrative separate from deterministic risk and execution policy.
- Current capability and proposed platform behavior must be labeled separately.
- Add or update tests for changed behavior.
- Update the matching source-of-truth documentation in the same change.

## Verification

Use `docs/ops/verify-gates.md`. A skipped gate is `UNVERIFIED` or `BLOCKED`, not
a pass. Evidence must identify exact branch/SHA/runtime.

## Scope Hard Stop

Stop when implementation requires a new provider, production environment,
broker, live order, leverage/derivatives, risk-limit change, destructive data
operation, weakened data-quality rule, or public deployment not explicitly
approved by the user.
